 "context": "<figure id=\"fig-ch09_04_03\"><span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id2014249\" data-alt=\"Part a: This electron micrograph shows a film of bacteria. Part b: This photo shows a Hawaiian bobtail squid.\">\n    <img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/cd615647cec489da76e9042eb9328c136d9ece1a\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"Part a: This electron micrograph shows a film of bacteria. Part b: This photo shows a Hawaiian bobtail squid.\" width=\"520\" height=\"226\">\n</span>\n</figure>",
